Original work by David Y. Tan, including the tqLLM engine, the TurboQuant (TQ) weight formats (TQ3_1S, TQ3_4S, TQ3,
TQ4, TQ_XS to TQ_L), TqCache and TQueue. The TurboQuant method itself (arXiv 2504.19874, KV-cache and vector
quantization) is Google Research's work; the TQ weight formats apply its transform-quantization ideas to model weights.
